#### 11. No Surrender of Others' Freedom

If obligations are imposed on you by virtue of this License, such as
if you distribute copies of the Program or provide access to it, and
you offer in exchange a service or product whose value is
substantially derived from the operation of the Program, you must
make the Program available under this License and make its source
